OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for killing his dad
OL,4,Ain pub garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed his father on
OL,7,FChristmas Eve hours after finding out
OL,8,Fhe was his son has been jailed for six
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FMartin Greensmith, 37, only learnt
OL,12,FSteven Shevels, 61, was his biological
OL,13,Ffather shortly before their encounter
OL,14,Fat The Queen's Head in Willington,
OL,15,FCounty Durham, on 24 December.
OL,17,FGreensmith, who was found guilty of
OL,18,Fmanslaughter last month, said he only
OL,19,F"gently" pushed Shevels after the
OL,20,Fvictim "intimidated" him, but
OL,21,Fprosecutors maintained he had caused
OL,22,Fhis death during a fit of anger.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
