OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for killing his dad
OL,4,Ain pub garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a victim impact statement read at
OL,7,FNewcastle Crown Court, Shevels'
OL,8,Fdaughter Chloe said her father was a
OL,9,F"quiet and timid man" who loved nature
OL,10,Fand rock music.
